---
layout: default
---
{% comment %}
  Local override of al_folio_core's _layouts/about.liquid. Three changes:

  1. The social icon row (jekyll-socials' social-links tag) is captured and
     piped through the al_email_protect_html filter before output, in case
     an "email" key is ever added back to _data/socials.yml - that filter
     is defense in depth, not the primary display (see #3 below). The
     al_email_protect gem documents capturing the rendered HTML as the only
     interception point (jekyll-socials owns that markup, there's no render
     hook), but al_folio_core itself never actually wires it up - see
     al_email_protect-1.0.1/lib/al_email_protect.rb, "rewrite_html" comment.

  2. site.middle_name is wrapped in literal quote marks in the H1 title,
     since it holds a preferred name ("Ray"), not a real middle name.
     Deliberately done here in the template (plain text content) rather than
     by putting quote characters in the middle_name config value itself -
     that value is also interpolated unescaped into an HTML attribute
     (meta name="author") elsewhere, where literal quotes break the markup.

  3. site.contact_email (_config.yml) is rendered as obfuscated text
     ("user [at] domain [dot] tld") in the contact-note line below the
     social icons, via the al_email_obfuscate filter - no email icon/button,
     just protected text, per user request ("don't add a new button for
     email, use unscramble email text").

  Keep this in sync with upstream about.liquid if the theme updates it.
  NOTE: use {% raw %}...{% endraw %} around any literal Liquid tag syntax
  mentioned in comments here - Liquid executes tags inside HTML comments too.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="post">
  <header class="post-header">
    <h1 class="post-title">
      {% if site.title == 'blank' %}
        <span class="font-weight-bold">{{ site.first_name }}</span> "{{ site.middle_name }}"
        {{ site.last_name }}
      {% else %}
        {{ site.title }}
      {% endif %}
    </h1>
    <p class="desc">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
  </header>

  <article>
    {% if page.profile %}
      <div class="profile float-{% if page.profile.align == 'left' %}left{% else %}right{% endif %}">
        {% if page.profile.image %}
          {% assign profile_image_path = page.profile.image | prepend: 'assets/img/' %}
          {% if page.profile.image_circular %}
            {% assign profile_image_class = 'img-fluid z-depth-1 rounded-circle' %}
          {% else %}
            {% assign profile_image_class = 'img-fluid z-depth-1
      rounded' %}
          {% endif %}
          {% capture sizes %}(min-width: {{ site.max_width }}) {{ site.max_width | minus: 30 | times: 0.3}}px, (min-width: 576px)
      30vw, 95vw"{% endcapture %}
          {%
            include figure.liquid loading="eager" path=profile_image_path class=profile_image_class sizes=sizes alt=page.profile.image
            cache_bust=true
          %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if page.profile.more_info %}
          <div class="more-info">{{ page.profile.more_info }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="clearfix">{{ content }}</div>

    <!-- News -->
    {% if page.announcements and page.announcements.enabled %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">news</a>
      </h2>
      {% include news.liquid limit=true %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Latest posts -->
    {% if page.latest_posts and page.latest_posts.enabled %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/blog/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">latest posts</a>
      </h2>
      {% include latest_posts.liquid %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Selected papers -->
    {% if page.selected_papers %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">selected publications</a>
      </h2>
      {% include selected_papers.liquid %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Social -->
    {% if page.social %}
      <div class="social">
        <div class="contact-icons">
          {% capture social_links_html %}{% social_links %}{% endcapture %}
          {{ social_links_html | al_email_protect_html }}
        </div>

        <div class="contact-note">
          {{ site.contact_note }}
          {% if site.contact_email %}
            Email: {{ site.contact_email | al_email_obfuscate }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if site.newsletter and site.newsletter.enabled and site.footer_fixed %}
      {% if site.plugins contains 'al_newsletter' %}
        {% include plugins/al_newsletter_form_center_margin.liquid %}
      {% else %}
        {% include newsletter.liquid center=true %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </article>
</div>
